-- copattern tiers: a user witness keeps the observation lemma a ⋆
-- (discharged by the witness's own computation here); an unguarded
-- body degrades the batch to DECLARATIONS — reported open, never a
-- wall
def conat : 𝕌 ≔ ν (K 𝟙 ⊎ 𝕏)
def czero : conat using (conat.unfold) ≔ corec (s : 𝟙. inj₁ s) ()
  | out (czero) ≔ inj₁ ()
def bad : conat → conat using (conat.unfold)
  | out (bad n) ≔ out (bad n)
